Gap 1 (client-offline-v2):
- sw.js: 'sync' event handler (tag payesh-sync-queue) reads pending/failed
  ops from IndexedDB (payesh_offline_v2/sync_queue), POSTs them chunked
  (200/req) to /api/sync with HttpOnly cookie credentials; permanent-reject
  codes go dead (aligned with SYNC_DEAD_CODES), transient failures reject
  the sync so the browser retries with its own backoff; result is
  postMessage'd to open tabs (payesh-bgsync-done).
- 27-sync.js: bgMirrorQueue() mirrors the live queue into IDB (debounced,
  reconciled — synced/removed items are deleted so SW never re-sends),
  bgRegisterSync() registers the one-shot sync tag on every enqueue,
  bgListen()/bgApplyResult() reconcile local queue with background results
  (synced removed + lastSync advanced, rejected surfaced in panel).
- tests/bgsync.js: 14 checks (static SW contract + live jsdom mirror/reconcile).

Tests: smoke 547/547, bgsync 14/14, wave7 7/7, build --check 0, check-authz 0, secret-scan 11/11
